  "alert: NONE, RAIN, CIVIC or HEATWAVE. RAIN and CIVIC stand for an alert issued by the evaluation hour and valid for the whole window; HEATWAVE is a real kind the rule ignores.",
  "hourly_index_pct holds exactly consecutive_hours values, oldest first; null is an hour with nothing expected.",
  "Compare verdicts, not window decimals: the backend weights hours by the zone's expected sales, the mock weighs them equally, so window_index_pct may differ by one point. Every vector is chosen so that it does not change a condition or the verdict.",
  "expected.conditions are the five trigger conditions, met or not. expected.status is the detector's zone status."
